                                                "text": "grass clippings"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b73ab8a1-94e4-4633-a176-64750c122a9a",
                                                "sense_id": "b0e92c7a-dc2e-3a95-9a97-2ac604002f3a",
                                                "text": "I use a mulching mower and usually let the clippings go back to the lawn, but sometimes I'll gather clippings for mulching in the vegetable garden."
