                                                "sense_id": "21bf6d0e-c633-30ae-adb1-8ab55889247b",
                                                "text": "When a 90-year-old yellowed clipping appeared one day at my feet, an implausible new mystery entered my life."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00ccf80d-0ee0-3037-b02f-401b22409e3f",
                                        "entry_id": "9cf5843a-8b40-3248-90b2-9982c1272a90",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A process of word formation involving shortening by removal of syllables, often terminal ones."
